        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Simplify the expression <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac {6y + 2} {3xy + x}.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Simplify the expression [MATH: \\dfrac {6y + 2} {3xy + x}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any factors that they have in common.\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\require{cancel}\n\\eqalign{\n\\dfrac {6y + 2} {3xy + x} &amp;= \\dfrac {6y + 2} {x(3y + 1)} \\[5pt]\n&amp;=\\dfrac {2(3y + 1)} {x(3y + 1)} \\[5pt]\n&amp;=\\dfrac {2\\cancel{(3y + 1)} } {x \\cancel{(3y + 1)} } \\[5pt]\n&amp;=\\dfrac {2 } {x}\n}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any factors that they have in common.\n[MATH: \\require{cancel}\n\\eqalign{\n\\dfrac {6y + 2} {3xy + x} &= \\dfrac {6y + 2} {x(3y + 1)} \\[5pt]\n&=\\dfrac {2(3y + 1)} {x(3y + 1)} \\[5pt]\n&=\\dfrac {2\\cancel{(3y + 1)} } {x \\cancel{(3y + 1)} } \\[5pt]\n&=\\dfrac {2 } {x}\n}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSimplify the expression [MATH: \\dfrac {6y + 2} {3xy + x}.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any factors that they have in common.\n[MATH: \\require{cancel}\n\\eqalign{\n\\dfrac {6y + 2} {3xy + x} &= \\dfrac {6y + 2} {x(3y + 1)} \\[5pt]\n&=\\dfrac {2(3y + 1)} {x(3y + 1)} \\[5pt]\n&=\\dfrac {2\\cancel{(3y + 1)} } {x \\cancel{(3y + 1)} } \\[5pt]\n&=\\dfrac {2 } {x}\n}]"
      },
